{"2379230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blessed Burden", "steam_appid": 2379230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;There is no God anymore –</i> <br><i>Satan sits upon His throne.</i> <br><i>But hope for salvation is not yet lost,</i> <br><i>as long as one warrior of God still breathes.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/1922a493112e7ebf68d9642e9e67ee48.poster.avif?t=1780645913\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/1922a493112e7ebf68d9642e9e67ee48.webm?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/1922a493112e7ebf68d9642e9e67ee48.mp4?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the last priest, descending into the deepest depths to destroy the very essence of evil. Your path is filled with traps, lava, and fear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/719dbc32c375ff7a8efb96c80909e872.poster.avif?t=1780645913\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/719dbc32c375ff7a8efb96c80909e872.webm?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/719dbc32c375ff7a8efb96c80909e872.mp4?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing fast and aggressive or slow and steady <i>–</i> entirely up to you. Master your platforming skills while investigating the lore of the devil's adobe and collecting infernal relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/4f0eedbae6a5b9f6e71da7c3192e1d96.poster.avif?t=1780645913\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/4f0eedbae6a5b9f6e71da7c3192e1d96.webm?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/4f0eedbae6a5b9f6e71da7c3192e1d96.mp4?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILLS UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Bless Points to upgrade movement skills. Bless Points are awarded for completing levels and collecting full relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/a7c23ad4b66dba14ee5753ce22a01c59.poster.avif?t=1780645913\" width=796 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/a7c23ad4b66dba14ee5753ce22a01c59.webm?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/a7c23ad4b66dba14ee5753ce22a01c59.mp4?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEADERBOARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends and other players to see who can complete levels the fastest. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/7243e3e365713dad6aa64072ec45291f.avif?t=1780645913\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras_big/7243e3e365713dad6aa64072ec45291f.avif?t=1780645913 width=800 height=286 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURING</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels <i>–</i> from mushroom caves to brutalist megastructures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.5 hours for a first playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >horror-infused religious atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deconstructivist, brutalist, and infernal architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >retro visuals with a modern flair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique soundtrack <i>–</i> a fusion of church choirs, ritual percussion, and industrial sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > devil’s suspenseful monologues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >movement skill upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >leaderboard <i>–</i> compete with other players in level completion speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collecting infernal relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sliding on colossal roots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >riding giant snakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;There is no God anymore –</i> <br><i>Satan sits upon His throne.</i> <br><i>But hope for salvation is not yet lost,</i> <br><i>as long as one warrior of God still breathes.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/1922a493112e7ebf68d9642e9e67ee48.poster.avif?t=1780645913\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/237923