4f0eedbae6a5b9f6e71da7c3192e1d96.mp4?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILLS UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Bless Points to upgrade movement skills. Bless Points are awarded for completing levels and collecting full relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/a7c23ad4b66dba14ee5753ce22a01c59.poster.avif?t=1780645913\" width=796 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/a7c23ad4b66dba14ee5753ce22a01c59.webm?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/a7c23ad4b66dba14ee5753ce22a01c59.mp4?t=1780645913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEADERBOARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends and other players to see who can complete levels the fastest. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/7243e3e365713dad6aa64072ec45291f.avif?t=1780645913\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras_big/7243e3e365713dad6aa64072ec45291f.avif?t=1780645913 width=800 height=286 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURING</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels <i>–</i> from mushroom caves to brutalist megastructures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.5 hours for a first playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >horror-infused religious atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deconstructivist, brutalist, and infernal architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >retro visuals with a modern flair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique soundtrack <i>–</i> a fusion of church choirs, ritual percussion, and industrial sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > devil’s suspenseful monologues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >movement skill upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >leaderboard <i>–</i> compete with other players in level completion speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collecting infernal relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sliding on colossal roots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >riding giant snakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fast-paced first-person platformer with character upgrading. Begin your journey across the Devilish Megastructures as a frail, armless priest and grow stronger through sacred relics.", "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian, French, Japanese, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/f41247ebb4b6d1e38899f84f1bdcec831f6467c8/header.jpg?t=1780645913", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/8a5814d029b07b9b5436f19b1c02a67916b397fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780645913", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/8a5814d029b07b9b5436f19b1c02a67916b397fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780645913", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Re